{"id":"vod_sn_38429","vodId":"38429","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"我的妹妹哪有这么可爱","name_cn":"我的妹妹哪有这么可爱","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0c9d5f09d8e7b1d5584dfb1d9689cac4.jpg"},"summary":"家住千叶县的17岁普通高中生高坂京介（中村悠一 配音）有一个14岁的妹妹高坂桐乃（竹达彩奈 配音），可是，很长一段时间以来，这个外表可爱的妹妹和自己的关系并不密切，有时甚至可以用冷淡来形容。妹妹的身上究竟发生了怎样的事情呢？终于有一天，一个关于桐乃的秘密被京介发现了。　　可爱 的妹妹居然是宅系的兄控？！虽然桐乃百般否认，但事实不容狡辩。随后，原本只在妹妹身边出没的千金大小姐槙岛沙织（生天目仁美 配音）和毒舌少女五更琉璃（花泽香菜 配音）也渐渐的围绕到了京介的身边来，她们都和妹妹一样，是秋叶原系的御宅族。因为是兄控而觉得分外苦闷的桐乃，究竟会和妹控的哥哥京介发展出一段怎样妙趣横生的关系呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:01:22","playable":true,"episodeCount":32,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yGbjmQkqvQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YphJgDLG2v1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tVG8dTxSDh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Zp9AUgUjV01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UNBcmP3Ue11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mkBCLGeRrE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uEvZ8yEiZj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xrdvTx9xAc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2p7sZ8eEjx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/trBNB1qjMZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YXrUw8ydHp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9JT6XuqNtQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/R5Cy5axHJj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/M285s9i61p1/video/index.